y on the boundaries between skills.\",\n \"non_responsibilities\": [\n  [\n   \"Running the ADR, fitness-function and anti-legacy process\",\n   \"architecture-governance\"\n  ],\n  [\n   \"Scheduling work across agents and the ownership ledger\",\n   \"program-orchestration\"\n  ],\n  [\n   \"Architecture inside a domain (e.g. shading-path choice)\",\n   \"render-architect\"\n  ]\n ],\n \"provides\": [\n  \"C-ARCH\"\n ],\n \"consumes\": [],\n \"expertise\": [\n  \"engine architecture\",\n  \"requirements engineering\",\n  \"trade-off analysis\",\n  \"architecture views\"\n ]\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d1c2f04b-5040-43a3-a0c7-c7656d633c47","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:45:49.578Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"72ea71c6-3d9b-411b-af47-27650761a55d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
